    Functional Interfaces
           ↓
    Lambda Expressions
           ↓
    Method References
           ↓
        Streams

Examples:

Predicate → filter()
Function  → map()
Consumer  → forEach()
Supplier  → get()

Benefits:

Less Code
Better Readability
Parallel Processing
Easy Testing
Cleaner Stream Pipelines
